-- 287-card curated batch added 2026-10-02 from a user-curated list of 300
-- divisive/shareable dilemmas (originally grouped by informal vibe categories —
-- Relationships, Dating, Friends, Work, Money, Family & in-laws, Morally gray,
-- Petty/funny — remapped here to the 5 real posts.category values since those
-- groupings aren't DB categories). 13 of the original 300 were not inserted:
--   8 removed as exact/semantic duplicates of existing approved content or of
--     each other (see git history / conversation record for the specific list)
--   5 held back because they triggered the live moderation pipeline on what is
--     almost certainly harmless wording (e.g. a capitalized brand-name-as-verb
--     like "Googled"/"Venmo-requested" being misread as a proper name, and the
--     word "hurt" immediately before a pronoun matching an imperative-violence
--     check even in a purely descriptive, non-threatening sentence) — NOT
--     inserted, and the moderation code itself was deliberately left unchanged.
--
-- Insertion order below is pre-shuffled (greedy category-balanced interleave,
-- never two consecutive cards from the same category) purely so this file
-- itself doesn't read as thematic blocks — note this has no effect on live
-- serving order: get_feed()'s seed lane already does ORDER BY random() on
-- every fetch regardless of row insertion order (see get_feed() in
-- 20260809000003_get_feed.sql), which was intentionally left unchanged here.
-- Every line was run through the live submit-post moderation function before
-- insertion, since a direct seed insert bypasses that Edge Function entirely.

